    <Major>My Way of things</Major>
    <Description>Hey guys, so this is my way of doing things, I have Vaccine Master in F2, Organic Banana in F6 and XAI Rechargeable Energy in F7, also i use Digimon boosts and EXP Boosts, sorry i dont have it set in the macro, but i use it before i start the macro so i can get more out of it. Well i basically use this at Kaiser Domain so i can try to get more levels as fast as i can. but people can also use this for Tera Farming, It all depends if you have the resources to keep it up.

I Wish you all luck with this, and i hope you guys get what you want from this macro, if not than i am sorry for wasting your time on something so silly.

Sincerely, Ninjafreak</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download</Comment>
